  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanitation assistance AECID RRM 2023-27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF will collaborate with the CMWU and any community structure at the informal IDP settlement to assess and locate the most suitable placement of the latrines and showers, and ideally in a location that would enable their connection to the water supply and sewagesystems. The supplier will deliver the prefab units to the sites as identified by PEF, and Water Mission will install the units, and connect the water supply and sewer systems. As Oxfam will procure and secure the import of the handwashing stations, it will coordinate with PEF on the placement of the stations.</narrative>
  </description>
